## 7. Component Conventions

### Styling Rules

1. **Dark mode first.** Use `dark:` prefix for dark variants, plain classes for light. The `<html>` element toggles `class="dark"`.
2. **Color palette:**
   - Backgrounds: `bg-[#0d1117]` (deepest), `bg-[#161b22]` (panels), `bg-[#1c2128]` (cards), `bg-[#21262d]` (hover)
   - Borders: `border-[#30363d]`
   - Text: `text-white` (primary), `text-gray-400`/`text-gray-500` (secondary)
   - Status colors: emerald=success, rose/red=failed, amber/yellow=pending, sky/blue=processing, gray=cancelled
3. **CSS variables** are used in extracted components (QueueTable, StatsBar, Toast): `var(--panel-bg)`, `var(--panel-border)`, `var(--text-primary)`, `var(--text-secondary)`, `var(--card-shadow)`, `var(--accent-color)`.
4. **Font size convention:** `text-[10px]` for labels/badges, `text-xs` for secondary, `text-sm` for body.
5. **Uppercase labels:** `text-[10px] font-black uppercase tracking-widest` is the standard label style.
6. **Border radius:** `rounded-xl` for cards/panels, `rounded-lg` for inputs/buttons, `rounded-full` for badges/pills.
7. **Glass morphism:** `backdrop-blur-xl` + semi-transparent backgrounds on panels.

### Modal Pattern

All modals follow this structure (see SaveFolderModal, StopWorkerModal, etc.):

```jsx
<div className="fixed inset-0 bg-black/80 backdrop-blur-sm z-[200] flex items-center justify-center p-4">
    <div className="bg-white dark:bg-[#161b22] border border-gray-200 dark:border-[#30363d] w-full max-w-sm rounded-xl shadow-2xl overflow-hidden">
        {/* Header: p-4 border-b bg-gray-50 dark:bg-[#1c2128] */}
        {/* Body: p-4 space-y-4 */}
        {/* Error bar (conditional) */}
        {/* Footer: p-4 bg-gray-50 dark:bg-[#0d1117] flex justify-end gap-2 border-t */}
    </div>
</div>
```

### Component Props Pattern

Components receive callbacks and data, never fetch their own data:
```jsx
// CORRECT
<QueueTable jobs={queue} onDelete={handleDelete} onRefresh={() => fetchAllData(true)} />

// WRONG — components should not call ApiService directly
```

